       &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                             =
       &lt;p&gt;In the first step, connect the printer to WiFi.&lt;/p&gt;=0A           =
                                                     &lt;/li&gt;=0A              =
                                                  &lt;li&gt;=0A                  =
                                                  &lt;p&gt;Then, download the pri=
nter driver from the official page.=0A                                     =
                               &lt;/p&gt;=0A                                     =
                           &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                        =
                        &lt;li&gt;=0A                                            =
                        &lt;p&gt;Next, double-tap the downloaded file.&lt;/p&gt;=0A    =
                                                            &lt;/li&gt;=0A       =
                                                         &lt;li&gt;=0A           =
                                                         &lt;p&gt;Now, you have t=
o complete the installation steps.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                  =
                              &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                     =
                           &lt;li&gt;=0A                                         =
                           &lt;p&gt;In the next step, tap the Window key + R.&lt;/p&gt;=
=0A                                                                &lt;/li&gt;=0A=
                                                                &lt;li&gt;=0A    =
                                                                &lt;p&gt;Next, th=
e Run dialogue box will open.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                       =
                         &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                          =
                      &lt;li&gt;=0A                                              =
                      &lt;p&gt;Now, enter =E2=80=9Ccontrol/name Microsoft.Devices=
AndPrinters.=E2=80=9D=0A                                                   =
                 &lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                   =
             &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                      =
          &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                          =
          &lt;p&gt;After that, click the OK button.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                       =
